    ontouml:description """Sex at birth is decomposed into male, female, and indeterminate categories, supporting representation of assigned sex at birth as a distinct classification. A person category is included to represent individuals with an assigned sex at birth.

Specialized person categories correspond to each sex-at-birth category, distinguishing male-at-birth-sex persons, female-at-birth-sex persons, and indeterminate-at-birth-sex persons. This supports consistent person classification derived from assigned sex at birth while keeping sex-at-birth categories distinct from other sex classifications.""" ;
    ontouml:name "Sex at Birth Specializations"@en ;
    ontouml:owner :QPpjNDmD.AAAARYE ;
    ontouml:project :qmUW4emAUygeIwWe .

