        :jsO0tDmAUygefh.K,
        :opB9tDmAUygefhqh,
        :rsO0tDmAUygefh.M ;
    ontouml:description """Indeterminate Sex captures cases that do not align with a determinate male or female classification. Phenotypic Ambiguous Sex refines this notion for phenotypic assessment, and Sex-at-birth Indeterminate Sex further refines it to the context of registration at birth.

Indeterminate-sex Person is specialized in parallel, with Phenotypic Ambiguous-sex Person and Sex-at-birth Indeterminate-sex Person preserving the same refinement pattern at the level of persons. The corresponding links keep person classification aligned with the indeterminate sex outcomes used as its basis.""" ;
    ontouml:name "Indeterminate Sex"@en ;
    ontouml:owner :3zRjNDmD.AAAARX7 ;
    ontouml:project :qmUW4emAUygeIwWe .

