:MDvPkDmAUygefiQm a ontouml:Class ;
    ontouml:description """An Administrative Male-gender Person is a person whose administrative gender assignment is male. This classification concerns an administrative recognition of a male gender for the person, as established by an organization acting as an administrative gender recognizer and recorded through an administrative gender recognition.

