:q9yQUDmAUygefi9r a ontouml:Class ;
    ontouml:description """A Self-identified Cisgender Male Person is a person who self-identifies as cisgender and as male.

This class applies when the person's self-identified male gender is consistent with the person's male sex at birth, so the cisgender status is grounded in self-identification rather than in external attribution.""" ;
