    ontouml:description """Sex-at-birth Determinate-sex Person is a Sex-at-birth-assigned Person whose recorded sex-at-birth classification is determinate, namely Sex-at-birth Male Sex or Sex-at-birth Female Sex. It excludes individuals whose sex at birth is recorded as Sex-at-birth Indeterminate Sex.

