:18CztDmAUygefh8h a ontouml:Class ;
    ontouml:description """Man is a person classified in the male category. It serves as a general category that covers persons classified by sex as male and persons classified by gender as male.

Sex-based male classification includes variants based on sex at birth, phenotypic sex, and karyotypic sex. Gender-based male classification includes variants based on self-identification, external attribution, legal recognition, administrative recognition, and masculine presentation. This category can be used when one or both kinds of information are available, without requiring their agreement.""" ;
    ontouml:isAbstract false ;
    ontouml:isDerived false ;
    ontouml:isExtensional false ;
    ontouml:isPowertype false ;
    ontouml:name "Man"@en ;
    ontouml:order "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    ontouml:project :qmUW4emAUygeIwWe ;
    ontouml:restrictedTo ontouml:functionalComplexNature ;
    ontouml:stereotype ontouml:subkind .

:3OxSoDmGAqAEHBvs a ontouml:Class ;
    ontouml:description "Externally-attributed Non-binary Gender is a non-binary gender designation attributed to a person by an external party. It captures non-binary gender attributions made by someone other than the person, without assuming that the attribution matches the person's self-identified gender or gender expression." ;
    ontouml:isAbstract false ;
    ontouml:isDerived false ;
    ontouml:isExtensional false ;
    ontouml:isPowertype false ;
    ontouml:name "Externally-attributed Non-binary Gender"@en ;
